@startuml twed-numeric-operation-paths
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Sans"
skinparam ArrowColor #315678
skinparam ArrowThickness 2
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #315678
  FontColor #102027
  BackgroundColor #E3F2FD
}
left to right direction

title Physical-time TWED numeric paths and result authority

rectangle "Typed series and request\nunit, origin, parameters, cutoff, limits" as Admission #E8F5E9
rectangle "Scalar bounded scorer\ndense rolling binary64 DP" as Scalar #E3F2FD
rectangle "Online automaton\nowned query, transactional sparse prefix" as Online #E3F2FD
rectangle "Indexed range\ncaptured dictionary view and decoded boxes" as Range #E1F5FE
rectangle "Interval frontier\ncandidate lower bounds" as Bound #FFF3CD
rectangle "Terminal verifier\nfull-precision score_exact" as Verify #E3F2FD
rectangle "Conditional subtree prune\nrequires a machine inequality proof" as Prune #FFEBEE
rectangle "Indexed kNN\nall-original scan and bounded heap" as Knn #E3F2FD
rectangle "Public result\noperation-specific cutoff, failure, resource, completion" as Result #E8F5E9

Admission --> Scalar : scalar
Admission --> Online : online
Admission --> Range : indexed range
Admission --> Knn : indexed kNN
Knn --> Verify : score each original
Range --> Bound : each label
Bound --> Verify : surviving terminal
Bound --> Prune : empty frontier
Scalar --> Result
Online --> Result
Verify --> Range : range: continue DFS
Verify --> Knn : kNN: update heap
Prune --> Range : continue DFS
Range --> Result : exhausted, paused, or failed
Knn --> Result : exhausted or failed

note bottom of Bound #FFF9E5
  Interval arithmetic is not yet proved to bound
  every executed binary64 verifier score.
end note

note bottom of Prune #FFEBEE
  A real-valued lower bound alone does not
  authorize a machine-score subtree prune.
end note
@enduml
